title: Negotiations for our entry into the Bauer Cabinet.
subtitle: Reconciliation with our coalition partners..
new-page: true
view-if: year == 1919 and month == 10 and chancellor == "Bauer"
priority: 1
tags: event
max-visits: 1

= Reentry Into the Bauer Cabinet

<img src="img/portraits/BauerGustav.jpeg" style="float:left; margin-right:1em; margin-bottom:0.5em; width:220px; object-fit:cover; object-position:top; border:2px solid #000000ff;"> Ever since the acceptance of the humiliating treaty of Versailles in June, our formal participation in the government has been hindered by the SPD and Z’s bitterness over our desire to “evade responsibility”, and by our fundamental criticism of the plans by the SPD and Economic Minister Wissell's plans for a <span style="color: var(--kpd-colour);">socialization</span> of the economy, with earlier negotiations in July being rejected by both our party and the cabinet. But now, we have been approached again and we must decide whether or not to enter government.

- @this_is_the_only_option: Approve our renewed participation in government.
- @no_way_to_pick_this: Refuse to enter government and enter the opposition.

@this_is_the_only_option
on-arrival: in_weimar_coalition = 1; leverage = ddp_r
go-to: ministries

After a few days of negotiations, we have officially re-entered government with the <span style="color: var(--z-colour);">We</span><span style="color: var(--spd-colour);">im</span><span style="color: var(--ddp-colour);">ar</span> Coalition, as Bauer welcomes us in.

@ministries

We can pick from any number of ministries. Controlling a ministry allows us to directly effect policy in that area. 

- @labor
- @interior
- @finance
- @economic
- @justice
- @foreign
- @agriculture
- @reichswehr
- @no_more
- @drop_labor
- @drop_interior
- @drop_finance
- @drop_economic
- @drop_justice
- @drop_foreign
- @drop_agriculture
- @drop_reichswehr

@labor
title: Labor Ministry
subtitle: The Labor Ministry handles labor affairs.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 5
view-if: labor_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 5; labor_minister_party = "DDP"; labor_minister = "Lemmer"
go-to: ministries

Ersnt Lemmer of the [+ ddp_name +] has been appointed labor minister.

@interior
title: Interior Ministry
subtitle: The Interior Ministry controls domestic security.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 5
view-if: interior_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 5; interior_minister_party = "DDP"; interior_minister = "Koch-Weser"
go-to: ministries

Erich Koch-Weser of the [+ ddp_name +] has been appointed Interior Minister.

@finance
title: Finance Ministry
subtitle: The Finance Ministry controls the government budget and taxes.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 10 
view-if: finance_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; finance_minister_party = "DDP"; finance_minister = "Dietrich"
go-to: ministries

Hermann Dietrich of the [+ ddp_name +] has been appointed Finance Minister.

@economic
title: Economic Ministry
subtitle: The Economic Ministry controls broader economic policy.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 10 
view-if: economic_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; economic_minister_party = "DDP"; economic_minister = "Hamm"
go-to: ministries

Eduard Hamm of the [+ ddp_name +] has been appointed Economic Minister.

@justice
title: Justice Ministry
subtitle: The Justice Ministry controls the courts.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 10 
view-if: justice_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 10
go-to: choose_justice

@choose_justice

Who should become Justice Minister?

-@schiffer: Eugen Schiffer.
-@blunck: Andreas Blunck

@schiffer
on-arrival: justice_minister_party = "DDP"; justice_minister = "Schiffer"
go-to: ministries

@blunck
on-arrival: justice_minister_party = "DDP"; justice_minister = "Blunck"
go-to: ministries

@foreign
title: Foreign Ministry
subtitle: This controls foreign affairs and our relationships with our neighbours.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 10 
view-if: foreign_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; foreign_minister_party = "DDP"; foreign_minister = "Rathenau"
go-to: ministries

Walter Rathenau of the [+ ddp_name +] has been appointed Foreign Minister.


@agriculture
title: Agricultural Ministry
subtitle: This handles agriculture and also other things such as land reform, etc..
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 10 
view-if: agriculture_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; agriculture_minister_party = "DDP"; agriculture_minister = "Böhme"
go-to: ministries


Karl Böhme of the [+ ddp_name +] has been appointed Agriculture Minister.

@reichswehr
title: Reichswehr Ministry
subtitle: The Ministry responsible for the armed forces.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
choose-if: leverage >= 15 
view-if: reichswehr_minister_party != "DDP"
on-arrival: leverage -= 15; reichswehr_minister_party = "DDP"; reichswehr_minister = "Gessler"
go-to: ministries

Otto Gessler of the [+ ddp_name +] has been appointed Reichswehr Minister.



@no_more
title: No more ministries.
subtitle: [? if leverage >= 10 : We still have some more leverage to gain ministries. ?][? if leverage < 10 : We do not have much leverage left. ?]

This coalition arrangement is tolerable to all.

@drop_labor
title: Drop the Labor Ministry.
view-if: labor_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: labor_minister_party = "SPD"; labor_minister = "Schlicke"; leverage += 5;
go-to: ministries

@drop_interior
title: Drop the Interior Ministry.
view-if: interior_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: interior_minister_party = "SPD"; interior_minister = "David"; leverage += 5;
go-to: ministries

@drop_finance
title: Drop the Finance Ministry.
view-if: finance_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: finance_minister_party = "Z"; finance_minister = "Erzberger"; leverage += 5
go-to: ministries

@drop_economic
title: Drop the Economic Ministry.
view-if: economic_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: economic_minister_party = "SPD"; economic_minister = "Schmidt"; leverage += 10
go-to: ministries

@drop_justice
title: Drop the Justice Ministry.
view-if: justice_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: justice_minister_party = "Others"; justice_minister = "Vacant"; leverage += 10;
go-to: ministries

@drop_foreign
title: Drop the Foreign Ministry.
view-if: foreign_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: foreign_minister_party = "SPD"; foreign_minister = "Müller"
go-to: ministries

@drop_agriculture
title: Drop the Agriculture Ministry.
view-if: agriculture_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: agriculture_minister_party = "SPD"; agriculture_minister = "Schmidt"; leverage += 10
go-to: ministries

@drop_reichswehr
title: Drop the Reichswehr Ministry.
view-if: reichswehr_minister_party = "DDP"
on-arrival: reichswehr_minister_party = "SPD"; reichswehr_minister = "Noske"; leverage += 15;
